step The pool by Sandsorrow Watch
  tip Ride north-west to the Sandfury troll camp at Sandsorrow Watch. Use the Untapped Dowsing Widget at the edge of its pool to tap it; the trolls stand close, so pull the nearest first.
  tip Careful: tapping the pool brings Scarabs (level 44-47) out of the sand to attack you: tap it, then step away from the trolls and fight the Scarabs one by one.
  use 8584 quest 992.1 @39.9,28.4 "Pool by Sandsorrow Watch" -- Gives the Tapped Dowsing Widget

