  zone Tanaris
  tip Zul'Farrak is a dungeon for a group of five; its quests here are level 45 to 47. Its gate lies about 400 yards north of the pool.
  tip Inside: the Scarabs drop the shells, every Sandfury troll can drop Troll Temper, and Sergeant Bly carries the Divino-matic Rod.
  enter "Zul'Farrak" @38.7,20.1
  complete 2865 @38.7,20.1            -- Scarab Shells: the Scarabs, inside
  complete 3042 @38.7,20.1            -- Troll Temper: the Sandfury trolls, inside
  complete 2768 @38.7,20.1            -- Divino-matic Rod: Sergeant Bly, inside

