# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The deep desert

step The Broken Pillar
  tip Ride south to the dig camp at the Broken Pillar. Marvon hands you a detector helm: wear it to see the Gahz'ridian mounds, which lie thick in the sand around the camp and south-west toward the ogres.
  accept 3161                         -- Marvon Rivetseeker
  collect 8443 quest 3161             -- Gahz'ridian Ornament
  turnin 3161

step Rhapsody's Kalimdor Kocktail
  collect 6257 quest 1452.1 @43.5,40.6 map 1446

step Dunemaul Compound
  tip Ride south-west to the ogre compound and keep to its south end; the compound's quest waits for the Un'Goro guide.
  tip Why the grind to 47: Tooga waits at the edge of the Thistleshrub Valley (mobs of 48-50). Grind it on the Dunemaul Ogres (45-46) at the compound's south end, the safer camp, not on the Brutes and Enforcers (46-48) inside.
  collect 278186 quest 97530          -- Brilliantly Polished Bangle, from any Dunemaul ogre
  level 47.06 grind 5471               -- grind on Dunemaul Ogre, at the compound's south end

step Tooga's escort
  tip The little turtle Tooga wanders the west edge of the Thistleshrub Valley, most often where the arrow leads: take him from the edge and leave the Thistleshrubs (48-50) alone. Lead him home to his wife Torta, by the water just east of Steamwheedle Port: he walks slowly and the desert's beasts go for him, so keep him alive.
  accept 1560 @30.2,70.7 map 1446              -- Tooga
  complete 1560
  turnin 1560                         -- Torta
  accept 97540                        -- Tooga, beside her: Oasis
  turnin 97540

step Steamwheedle Port
  tip From Torta, Steamwheedle Port is just west along the shore.
  turnin 97530                        -- Security Chief Bilgewhizzle, inside

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The south

step Caliph Scorpidsting
  tip Ride south-east to Waterspring Field. Caliph stands in the middle of the southern Wastewander camp: clear around him first.
  tip Careful: Two stealthed Wastewander Rogues travel with him wherever he goes. At his spawn camp, two shadowmages and their minions are close enough to join a fight with him. Out by the towers you can fight him without them.
  collect 8723 x1 quest 2781          -- Caliph Scorpidsting's Head

step Gadgetzan
  turnin 2781                         -- Chief Engineer Bilgewhizzle

